# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PARTICIPANT DATA — NEVER COMMIT
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repository is public-adjacent (a private GitHub remote is still a copy
# on someone else's server). Nothing that could identify a participant, and no
# collected data, may ever enter git history. Once committed, a file is in the
# history even after deletion.
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.wav
*.m4a
*.jsonl
/data/
/export/
/mirror/
**/participant_data/
allocation*.csv          # the sealed randomisation list
pin_hash*
*.local.json

